      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Corvidae in general are pretty clever - I&#39;ve seen footage on telly of a crow sitting on the edge of an open-topped public rubbish bin, leaning ina dn pulling out the black sack with his beak, then having the foresight to stand on the bit he&#39;s pulled up so it doesn&#39;t fall back in again, and repeating the process till some discarded food comes into reach and he can eat it :D.</p>",
